;
; How Gesso files one layer in MYRA (gesso_rules.h GR7): its place in the
; stack (0 .. 7), what it does (1 brightness, 2 contrast, 3 a grey wash),
; its amount (a delta, a gain in hundredths of a percent or a grey level),
; its opacity (0 .. 255) and whether it is shown (1) or hidden (0). Gesso
; asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXGESSO(layer:i1) = kind:i1! ^ amount:i5! ^ opacity:i3! ^ visible:i1!
